<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111972" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοινῑκό-εις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοῖνιξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					1
				</span></i>
			) 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοινίκεος</span>
			, <i>dark-red, purple</i> or <i>crimson,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλαῖνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.133
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.500
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡνία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					95
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμώδιγγες . . αἵματι φοινικόεσσαι</span>
			<i>red</i> with blood, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.717
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἵματι φοινικόεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Sc.</u>
					194
				</span></i>
			. [In <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοινικόεσσαι, -όεσσαν, -όεντα,</span>
			must be pronounced as if contracted, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				41.352
			</span></i>.]</div>
